{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-110894-r4587354","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Cherry-Berry Jumble Fruit Pie","sourcePageId":110894,"sourceRevision":"4587354","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-10-26T23:35:07Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Codename Noreste","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Cherry-Berry%20Jumble%20Fruit%20Pie&oldid=4587354","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T12:35:17.827Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Baking recipes","Category:Inexpensive recipes","Category:Medium Difficulty recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for dessert","Category:Recipes for pies and tarts","Category:Recipes using blackberry","Category:Recipes using blueberry","Category:Recipes using butter","Category:Recipes using cherry","Category:Recipes using cornstarch","Category:Recipes using lemon juice","Category:Recipes using raspberry","Category:Recipes using wheat flour","Category:Recipes using white sugar","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without servings","Category:Vegetarian recipes"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"ad810b5e36f9d5b748f3d55776e1850ea2647697c3ab5721d8021a7de35328a4","sourceWikitext":"{{recipesummary|category=Recipes for dessert|yield=8 slices|time=1 hour|difficulty=3}}\n{{recipe}} | [[Cookbook:Cuisine of the United States|American cuisine]] | [[Cookbook:Vegetarian cuisine|Vegetarian Cuisine]] | [[Cookbook:Dessert|Dessert]]\n==Ingredients==\n\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] canned sweet [[Cookbook:Cherry|cherries]] with juice\n* ¾ cup white [[Cookbook:Sugar|sugar]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] [[Cookbook:Cornstarch|cornstarch]]\n* 1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Flour|flour]]\n* 1¼ cups fresh [[Cookbook:Blueberry|blueberries]]\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Raspberry|raspberries]]\n* ¾ cup fresh [[Cookbook:Blackberry|blackberries]]\n* 1½ cups fresh [[Cookbook:Strawberry|strawberries]], sliced\n* 2 tablespoons strawberry [[Cookbook:Jam|preserves]]\n* 1 tablespoon fresh [[Cookbook:Lemon Juice|lemon juice]]\n* 2 store-bought or homemade [[Cookbook:Pie Crust|pie crusts]]\n* 1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Butter|butter]], melted\n\n==Procedure==\n\n# Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to [[Cookbook:Oven temperatures|350°F]] (175°C)\n# Drain cherries, reserving juice; set cherries aside.\n# Add water to juice if necessary to make ½ cup liquid.\n# In a large [[Cookbook:Saucepan|saucepan]], mix together cherry juice, sugar, cornstarch and flour. Stir until smooth, then cook on medium heat until it starts to thicken.\n# Add fruit, preserves and lemon juice. Mix well.\n# Place 1 crust in a 9-[[Cookbook:Inch|inch]] (23 [[Cookbook:Centimetre (cm)|cm]]) [[Cookbook:Pie and Tart Pans|pie pan or plate]]. Spoon in fruit filling.\n# Cut several slits in the middle of the second crust and place it over the filling.\n# Crimp the edges, and [[Cookbook:Brush|brush]] with melted butter.\n# [[Cookbook:Bake|Bake]] until the pie is golden brown, 40 to 45 minutes. Oven temperatures vary, so the time may vary.\n\n[[Category:Inexpensive recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for pies and tarts]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cherry]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Vegetarian recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using raspberry]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Reci